qrb-video-lib (0.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Rename source package from qrb-video-v4l2-lib to qrb-video-lib to reflect
    that the library now supports both V4L2 and VIDC backends.
  * Rename runtime package libqrb-video-v4l2-1 -> libqrb-video-codec-1 and
    development package libqrb-video-v4l2-dev -> libqrb-video-codec-dev.
    SOVERSION is unchanged at 1; the shared object is now libqrb_video_codec.so.
  * Note: this is a breaking rename. Consumers must update their package
    dependencies and link against -lqrb_video_codec instead of -lv4l2codecs.

 -- Jean Xiao <jianxiao@qti.qualcomm.com>  Thu, 04 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0000

